FV2021 Coleopteran (40 MP)
--------------------------

A humanoid walker three metres tall, built in Britain and fielded
by Canada's forces on Mars.  Its pilot wears a “thought-linked”
helmet, and the link is what makes it so nimble.  The helmet is
tuned to one pilot's brain — a new pilot must wait a day while it
is retuned; until then, halve the Defence Mastery and Combat
Technique: Lightning Reflexes Attribute bonuses.  The paint is the
usual UN scheme, white with sky-blue heads.


